  "privacyPolicyTitle": "Privacy Policy",
  "privacyEffectiveDate": "Effective Date",
  "privacyOpenExternal": "Open in browser",
  "privacyContactTitle": "Contact Us",
  "privacyContactBody": "If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or wish to exercise your data rights, contact us at: {email}",

  "privacyP1Title": "1. Introduction",
  "privacyP1Body": "Lune (\"we\", \"us\", or \"our\") is a menstrual cycle tracking application designed to help users monitor their health and wellness. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal information when you use our mobile application and related services. By using Lune, you agree to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree, please discontinue use of the application.",

  "privacyP2Title": "2. Information We Collect",
  "privacyP2Body": "We collect the following types of information:\n\n• Health & Cycle Data: Menstrual cycle dates, symptoms, moods, flow levels, and other health-related entries you voluntarily log.\n• Account Information: Email, display name, and sign-in method when you register (email/password, Google, or Apple). If you use the app as a guest, we create an anonymous Firebase account linked to your device without collecting your email.\n• Community Content: Posts, comments, reactions, and profile information you share in community features (if you opt in).\n• Device Information: Basic device identifiers required for push notifications, app security (Firebase App Check), and app functionality.\n• AI Chat Data: Messages you send to our AI assistant are processed by third-party AI providers to generate responses. Guest users: chat history stays on your device only. Registered users: chat history may be stored in your cloud account (Firebase) to restore conversations.\n• Usage & Diagnostics: Approximate last-active timestamp and crash/error reports via Firebase Crashlytics in release builds to help us fix bugs. We do not use third-party advertising trackers.",

  "privacyP3Title": "3. How We Use Your Information",
  "privacyP3Body": "Your information is used to:\n\n• Provide core cycle tracking, predictions, and personalized insights.\n• Deliver AI-powered health guidance and daily briefings.\n• Enable community features (posts, comments, stories) if you opt in.\n• Process cloud backups if you enable encrypted backup.\n• Send optional notifications (period reminders, pill reminders).\n• Improve app performance, diagnose crashes, and fix bugs.\n• Ensure safety and prevent misuse of community features.",

  "privacyP4Title": "4. Data Storage & Security",
  "privacyP4Body": "Your cycle and health data is stored locally on your device by default. If you enable cloud sync, your data is encrypted using AES-256 encryption and stored securely in Google Firebase (Firestore). Encryption keys are stored in your device's secure storage (Android Keystore / iOS Keychain). We implement industry-standard security measures including TLS encryption, secure authentication, and access controls.",

  "privacyP5Title": "5. Third-Party Services",
  "privacyP5Body": "We use the following third-party services:\n\n• Google Firebase (Authentication, Firestore, Cloud Functions, Cloud Messaging, Hosting, App Check, Crashlytics): Accounts, data storage, push notifications, security, and crash reporting.\n• Google Gemini AI: AI chat and content processing. Messages are sent to Google for processing per Google's API terms.\n• DeepSeek AI: Alternative AI provider for chat and analysis when used by our backend. Messages are sent to DeepSeek for processing per their API terms.\n• Google Play Billing: Premium subscription payments on Android (processed by Google).\n\nEach provider has its own privacy policy. We encourage you to review them. We do not sell your personal data.",

  "privacyP6Title": "6. Your Data Rights",
  "privacyP6Body": "You have the right to:\n\n• Access your data: View all data stored about you within the app.\n• Export your data: Download your cycle data as a local backup file.\n• Delete your data: Delete your account and all associated data permanently from the Privacy Center.\n• Revoke consent: Withdraw consent for cloud sync, AI features, or community participation at any time.\n• Opt out of notifications: Disable any notification type from settings.\n\nIf you are in the EU/UK, you may also have rights under GDPR/UK GDPR. To exercise these rights, use the in-app Privacy Center or contact us at the email below.",

  "privacyP7Title": "7. Children's Privacy",
  "privacyP7Body": "Lune is not intended for children under 13 years of age (or the applicable age of consent in your jurisdiction). We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If we discover that a child has provided us with personal data, we will delete it promptly. Parents or guardians who believe a child has used Lune should contact us immediately.",

  "privacyP8Title": "8. Data Retention",
  "privacyP8Body": "We retain your data for as long as you maintain an active account or as needed to provide services. If you delete your account, we immediately remove your Firestore profile, cloud backups, chat history, and community content from our servers and delete your Firebase Authentication account. Local data on your device remains until you uninstall the app or manually delete it. Technical backups at Firebase or Google Cloud may be retained briefly per their infrastructure policies. Crash reports in Crashlytics are retained according to Firebase's retention settings.",

  "privacyP9Title": "9. International Data Transfers",
  "privacyP9Body": "Your data may be processed in countries other than your own, including the United States where Google Firebase and AI provider servers may be located. By using Lune, you consent to the transfer of your data to these locations. We ensure appropriate safeguards are in place for international transfers. If you are in the EU/UK, you may have additional rights under GDPR/UK GDPR as described in section 6.",

  "privacyP10Title": "10. Medical Disclaimer",
  "privacyP10Body": "Lune is designed for informational and wellness tracking purposes only. It is not a medical device and does not provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for medical concerns. Do not rely solely on Lune's predictions or AI-generated content for health decisions.",

  "privacyP11Title": "11. Changes to This Policy",
  "privacyP11Body": "We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes through in-app notifications or email. Your continued use of Lune after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy. We encourage you to review this policy periodically.",

  "privacyP12Title": "12. Contact Us",
  "privacyP12Body": "For questions, concerns, or data requests related to this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:",

  "termsTitle": "Terms of Service",

  "termsP1Title": "1. Acceptance of Terms",
  "termsP1Body": "By downloading, installing, or using Lune (the \"App\"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service (\"Terms\"). If you do not agree to these Terms, do not use the App. These Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Lune.",

  "termsP2Title": "2. Description of Service",
  "termsP2Body": "Lune is a menstrual cycle tracking application that provides:\n\n• Cycle logging and prediction tools.\n• AI-powered health insights and chat assistance.\n• Self-care content and wellness recommendations.\n• Community features for sharing experiences.\n• Data backup and synchronization services.\n• Educational health content and magazine articles.\n\nThe App is intended for personal, non-commercial use only.",

  "termsP3Title": "3. User Accounts",
  "termsP3Body": "You may use Lune as a guest with an anonymous device-based account, or create a registered account using email/password, Google Sign-In, or Sign in with Apple (where available). You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account. You must be at least 13 years old to use the App. We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these Terms.",

  "termsP4Title": "4. User Conduct",
  "termsP4Body": "You agree NOT to:\n\n• Use the App for any unlawful purpose.\n• Post harmful, abusive, or misleading content in community features.\n• Impersonate another person or entity.\n• Attempt to access other users' accounts or data.\n• Upload viruses or malicious code.\n• Scrape, reverse-engineer, or decompile the App.\n• Use automated tools to interact with the App.\n• Spam or harass other community members.\n\nViolation of these rules may result in immediate account termination.",

  "termsP5Title": "5. Community Features",
  "termsP5Body": "Lune offers optional community features where users can share posts, comments, and stories. By posting content, you grant Lune a non-exclusive, royalty-free license to display, distribute, and store your content within the App. You retain ownership of your content. We reserve the right to remove content that violates these Terms or is reported by other users. You may block other users and manage your community privacy settings at any time.",

  "termsP6Title": "6. Subscriptions & Payments",
  "termsP6Body": "Lune offers premium features through in-app subscriptions processed via Google Play Billing. Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can manage subscriptions through your Google Play account settings. Refunds are handled according to Google Play's refund policy. Free features remain available without a subscription.",

  "termsP7Title": "7. Intellectual Property",
  "termsP7Body": "The App, including its design, code, graphics, logos, and content, is the intellectual property of Lune and is protected by copyright, trademark, and other laws. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative works based on the App without our express written permission. The Lune name, logo, and related marks are trademarks of Lune.",

  "termsP8Title": "8. Disclaimer of Warranties",
  "termsP8Body": "THE APP IS PROVIDED \"AS IS\" AND \"AS AVAILABLE\" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DO NOT WARRANT THAT THE APP WILL BE UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR-FREE, OR SECURE. THE APP IS NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE AND SHOULD NOT BE USED AS A SUBSTITUTE FOR PROFESSIONAL MEDICAL ADVICE, DIAGNOSIS, OR TREATMENT. CYCLE PREDICTIONS ARE ESTIMATES AND MAY NOT BE ACCURATE.",

  "termsP9Title": "9. Limitation of Liability",
  "termsP9Body": "TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, LUNE SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE APP. OUR TOTAL LIABILITY SHALL NOT EXCEED THE AMOUNT YOU PAID FOR THE APP IN THE 12 MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM. THIS LIMITATION APPLIES REGARDLESS OF THE LEGAL THEORY.",

  "termsP10Title": "10. Termination",
  "termsP10Body": "You may stop using the App at any time and delete your account through the Privacy Center. We may suspend or terminate your access if you violate these Terms or engage in harmful behavior. Upon termination, your right to use the App ceases immediately. Sections regarding intellectual property, disclaimers, and liability limitations survive termination.",

  "termsP11Title": "11. Governing Law & Contact",
  "termsP11Body": "These Terms are governed by the laws applicable in the jurisdiction of the Lune operator, except where mandatory consumer protection laws in your country of residence provide otherwise. Disputes shall first be resolved through good-faith negotiation. If you have questions about these Terms, contact us at:",

